WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:10.006
Vinnie helped the man to the monastery.

2
00:00:10.007 --> 00:00:15.041
When they arrived, Vinnie noticed a building in front.

3
00:00:15.042 --> 00:00:18.339
It looked like the one in the photo.

4
00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:24.001
"Won't you come inside?" asked the man.

5
00:00:24.002 --> 00:00:26.163
"What are these things called?"

6
00:00:26.164 --> 00:00:29.745
Vinnie asked, pointing to the building.

7
00:00:29.746 --> 00:00:32.948
"Pagodas," the man replied.

8
00:00:32.949 --> 00:00:36.871
"They are places to worship Buddha."

9
00:00:36.872 --> 00:00:41.372
"Teacher Hu, you are hurt!" a young man cried.

10
00:00:41.373 --> 00:00:44.407
He walked quickly over to them.

11
00:00:44.408 --> 00:00:46.443
"I am fine.

12
00:00:46.444 --> 00:00:49.405
My young friend helped me here, Sheng."

13
00:00:49.406 --> 00:00:55.429
Teacher Hu introduced his student to Vinnie and then said,

14
00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:59.289
"Let's thank Vinnie by showing him around."

15
00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:03.441
The monastery was very quiet and peaceful.

16
00:01:03.442 --> 00:01:08.769
Inside one temple was a very large statue of Buddha.

17
00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:11.655
There were candles burning around it.

18
00:01:11.656 --> 00:01:17.137
"Ah, I must stop and rest," said Teacher Hu.

19
00:01:17.138 --> 00:01:20.747
"Sheng will answer all your questions, Vinnie."

20
00:01:20.748 --> 00:01:25.907
Teacher Hu spoke quietly to his student for a moment.

21
00:01:25.908 --> 00:01:30.947
While the two men were talking, Vinnie took out the photo.

22
00:01:30.948 --> 00:01:34.356
The picture was not glowing blue.

23
00:01:34.357 --> 00:01:39.357
"It's not this place then," he said to himself.

24
00:01:39.358 --> 00:01:43.143
"What are you looking at?" asked Sheng.

25
00:01:43.144 --> 00:01:46.481
"Oh, nothing," Vinnie said.

26
00:01:46.482 --> 00:01:50.078
He shoved the photo back into his pocket.

27
00:01:50.079 --> 00:01:53.556
"Are there many pagodas in Chang'an?"

28
00:01:53.557 --> 00:01:57.031
"Quite a few," replied Sheng.

29
00:01:57.032 --> 00:02:03.113
"I'm looking for one with animal statues in front of it," Vinnie began.

30
00:02:03.114 --> 00:02:06.735
Sheng stared at him, confused.

31
00:02:06.736 --> 00:02:12.258
"The statues have sharp teeth and big eyes," said Vinnie.

32
00:02:12.259 --> 00:02:18.202
"Oh, you mean the Giant Wild Goose Pagoda!" cried Sheng.

33
00:02:18.203 --> 00:02:23.422
Back in the street, Mandy held on tightly to the monkey.

34
00:02:23.423 --> 00:02:27.816
The trainer was coming toward them on his horse.

35
00:02:27.817 --> 00:02:33.272
"Jinying! He's getting close!" Mandy cried.

36
00:02:33.273 --> 00:02:38.202
Mandy and Jinying ran down the busy street.

37
00:02:38.203 --> 00:02:44.147
Several uniformed men joined the chase behind the monkey trainer.

38
00:02:44.148 --> 00:02:46.675
"Stop—in the name of the Emperor!"

39
00:02:46.676 --> 00:02:50.497
shouted one guard, holding a club.

40
00:02:50.498 --> 00:02:55.805
Mandy and Jinying slowed down, gasping for breath.

41
00:02:55.806 --> 00:03:00.090
The monkey trainer also pulled up his horse.

42
00:03:00.091 --> 00:03:03.897
"Who are those men?" asked Mandy.

43
00:03:03.898 --> 00:03:08.625
"The Gold Bird Guards," panted Jinying.

44
00:03:08.626 --> 00:03:11.937
"They control traffic on the streets."

45
00:03:11.938 --> 00:03:16.356
"What is the problem here?" a guard asked Mandy.

46
00:03:16.357 --> 00:03:20.144
"She's a thief!" yelled the trainer.

47
00:03:20.145 --> 00:03:22.610
"She stole my monkey!"

48
00:03:22.611 --> 00:03:25.874
"Is this true?" asked the guard.

49
00:03:25.875 --> 00:03:28.064
"That man was speeding, sir,"

50
00:03:28.065 --> 00:03:31.743
said Jinying, pointing to the trainer.

51
00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:36.614
"In Chang'an, there is a strict penalty for those who speed on the roads."

52
00:03:36.615 --> 00:03:41.486
"You were going very fast," the guard said to the trainer.

53
00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:45.812
"But . . . but . . . ," the trainer stuttered.

54
00:03:45.813 --> 00:03:48.548
"What about my monkey?"

55
00:03:48.549 --> 00:03:52.280
The monkey was clinging to Mandy's shirt.

56
00:03:52.281 --> 00:03:55.050
"Does this man speak the truth?"

57
00:03:55.051 --> 00:03:58.497
the guard asked in a threatening voice.

58
00:03:58.498 --> 00:04:01.880
Mandy's eyes filled with tears.

59
00:04:01.881 --> 00:04:07.874
She could not imagine what would happen to her and to the monkey.

60
00:04:07.875 --> 00:04:12.356
"Sir, I . . . ," she began.

61
00:04:12.357 --> 00:04:15.606
Jinying suddenly stood tall.

62
00:04:15.607 --> 00:04:20.950
"This girl has broken no law!" he said in a strong voice.

63
00:04:20.951 --> 00:04:25.668
Another guard rode up and recognized the young man.

64
00:04:25.669 --> 00:04:29.867
"It's Master Yuan Jinying!" he cried.

65
00:04:29.868 --> 00:04:38.267
The guards all bowed to Jinying.
